cted invisibly?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"No. Every outbound link uses a same-origin resolver, shows a disclosure and renders rel=\\\"sponsored nofollow noopener\\\". Raw external href values are not emitted by the Connector renderer.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"What happens when consent is withdrawn?\",{\"className\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":[\"What happens when consent is withdrawn?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Connector stops outbound exchange, revokes its site secret and marks the connection disconnected. The latest local published snapshot stays in WordPress until the owner explicitly deletes it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Does PartnerOpen process payments?\",{\"className\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":[\"Does PartnerOpen process payments?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"No. PartnerOpen provides publishing data and the basis for an agreed share calculation. Payments and settlement remain between the Host, Creator or network under their legal agreement.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"What can Milestone 2 (M2) include?\",{\"className\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":[\"What can Milestone 2 (M2) include?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Milestone 2 is the publishing network package: multi-Host distribution, Organization → Site → Space administration, network health and the network-level audit flow. It is available by request; MCP and PartnerOpen GUI are available publication paths now.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Is Milestone 2 available now?\",{\"className\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":[\"Is Milestone 2 available now?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The publishing network package is 